                <pb facs="1017" n="903" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg903"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg842">p. 842</ref>,
                    records that Roosevelt dined with the Churchill family and Hopkins, and that
                    Roosevelt and Churchill were closeted for several hours following dinner. No
                    record of the discussion during or after dinner has been found.</p>
            </div>
